   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## A29 (a): SDR video -> 16-bit linear HDR (EXR half)\n\n1. **SDR clip** (Load Video) -> **Prepare Draft**: 24 fps, 1344x768, 121 frames padded to 124 (17k+5).\n2. **H3 Reference to Video** with the SDR clip as `<Video 1>` (ref_video_0), the **HDR IC-LoRA** on the Ref2VA model\n   (LoRA Loader Model Only), prompt from **H3 HDR Prompt**. The model generates the same shot as diffhdr_log_16384 LOG\n   pictures (flat and grey on screen - correct).\n3. **VAE Decode** -> **H3 HDR Log Decode** (linear, values above 1 kept) -> **H3 HDR Bias Correct** (undoes the VAE's\n   known -0.1..-0.4 stop darkening) -> keep the 121 real frames -> **Save EXR Sequence** (half, ZIP, output/hdr/...)\n   and **Tonemap Preview** (display only).\n\nModel files: see workflows/hdr/README_hdr.md. No clamp after Log Decode."
   ]
  }
